<title>POLAND: BYTOM TURNS TO PLN 0.8 MLN LOSS IN JULY.</title>
<headline>BYTOM TURNS TO PLN 0.8 MLN LOSS IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.80 vs   0.08 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.80 vs   0.19 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.19 vs   0.78 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    6.13 vs   5.48</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 4.68 vs   1.10 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   4.68 vs   2.20 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.61 vs   6.01 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   51.00 vs  47.36</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Odziezowe Bytom SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
